+window. A phone opens it from the pairing window's QR, whose payload is
+now a URL carrying the code, key and server id in the fragment
+(`core::invite_url`), pairs with `transport: "cookie"` into an
+`HttpOnly` cookie named for the server id, lists sessions with the
+waiting ones first, reads a Claude Code session's last response or any
+other session's screen, and sends a reply under `control` scope. The
+page polls `/waiting` every three seconds and uses `/api/v1/events`
+only as a hint that arrives sooner; `GET /api/v1/me` tells it its
+scope. No record changed. Known gaps: the one-line excerpt is not on
+the wire; the certificate is still self-signed with no subject
+alternative name, so a browser warns and proceeding is the trust step,
+and whether each browser offers that, keeps the exception, stores the
+cookie, or admits `wss://` is not measured (`spikes/23-web-page` was not
+run); a revoked device is told apart from an unknown one by the page
+reading `/info`, not by the host.
